    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404">

                <pb facs="0433" n="357" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg357"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File 838.51/526a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Minister Blanchard
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-08T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President, pursuant to treaty stipulations, has nominated Mr. Addison T. Ruan
                    as Financial Adviser as provided in Article II of Treaty.</p>
                <p>Inform the President as in case of previous nominations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
